- Document ADL deficits being addressed
- Get approval from case manager
- Update plan as needs change

COMMUNICATION:
- Maintain regular contact with care providers
- Communicate any changes in condition
- Report issues or concerns promptly
- Keep case manager informed of changes
- Document all communications

DOCUMENTATION:
